<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady/firm  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady/firm  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reduced supply slaughter steers and heifers moderately active, steady to firm. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1150-1350 lbs 63.50-64.85.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1200 lbs 63.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
